	(text "TPS61023 boost -> +5V for the EXTERNAL Waveshare IT8951 HAT (v1 board: HAT on an\nSPI connector - connector lives on the peripheral sheet). VOUT = 0.6V*(1+R10/R11)\n= 4.99V. True disconnect in shutdown; R12 holds it OFF until the MCU drives EPD_5V_EN."
